{"id":"discusio_n","lemma":"discusión","pos":"noun","rank":2002,"glosses":["discussion","argument","disagreement"],"ipa":"/diskuˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"discusiones"},"order":2034,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-discusi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"No veo razón para continuar esta discusión.","en":"I see no reason to continue this discussion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694171","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"reason"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to continue"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"El asunto aún está en discusión.","en":"The matter is still under discussion.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"matter"},{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Ella siempre gana las discusiones.","en":"She always wins arguments.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"best translated with to…"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}